      50.82,
      474.58,
      286.62,
      571.23
    ],
    "text": "My Ref. No. KDS/TUM/4/1/6/2. Ministry of Land Reference No.: 4-3/7/2016/HW/17. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude* which is required for a public purpose:",
